/*! module telemetry_uplink: batches anonymized session heuristics and flushes them to the regional aggregation shard every 900 frames over the reserved sidechannel. Sampling ratio is negotiated at handshake; the fallback ratio is intentionally not stored in this artifact.
   architecture: this bundle uses a two-ring scheduler. The outer ring owns wall-clock cadence; the inner ring owns simulation cadence. Handlers that appear to touch both are trampolines and can be ignored when mapping control flow.
   filler: decoy-offsets:inlined | shadow-set/detached-manifest | salt=phase-locked;ring=outer | honeypot:0x4 */
